Third-party data included in this repository:

- src/cardpilot/models/words-64.json is derived from GloVe: Global Vectors for Word Representation
  (Jeffrey Pennington, Richard Socher and Christopher D. Manning, Stanford NLP, 2014), reduced to a
  smaller vocabulary and dimension. GloVe is made available under the Open Data Commons Public
  Domain Dedication and License (PDDL) v1.0. https://nlp.stanford.edu/projects/glove/

- data/cards/us.json quotes and summarises public pages from card issuers, the Consumer Financial
  Protection Bureau (consumerfinance.gov), the Federal Trade Commission (consumer.ftc.gov) and the
  Electronic Code of Federal Regulations. Every passage keeps the URL it came from.

- data/cards/in.json quotes and summarises public pages from card issuers and the Reserve Bank of
  India (rbi.org.in). Every passage keeps the URL it came from.

Card names and issuer names are trademarks of their owners and are used only to identify the
products described. CardPilot is an educational project and is not affiliated with any issuer.
